WEBVTT

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.610
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:20.150
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:24.690
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:37.770
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:46.180
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:53.520
shining warmly.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:58.320
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:05.330
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:15.470
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:22.810
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:27.550
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:34.490
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:55.580
Mom, is this a little too childish?

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:58.450
Well, it is cute!..

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:01.180
I'll take this, and the same for Nanako too.

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:02.990
Matching pajamas!

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:05.250
We will be sewing pajamas next week in home economics.

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:07.320
Nanako-san?

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:11.260
Misonoo Nanako-san, I've told you about her...!

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:13.260
Oh, yes..

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:18.870
Pleased to meet you! I am Shinobu Mariko, Nanako's classmate.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:22.940
Sorry to stop by on a Sunday without calling.

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:25.740
but I have something I wanted to show Nanako.

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:28.540
Shinobu Mariko-san? <b> </b>

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:29.280
Shinobu Mariko-san? Yes!

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:33.820
I'm sorry, Nanako is out seeing a movie with her friend.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.550
Arikura Tomoko-san is her friend's name.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.360
I see.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:06.320
Say, what was is it that came between us?

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:08.390
What do you think it was?

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.660
Probably because you've gotten too popular!

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:15.390
What? <b> </b>

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:17.130
What? Like Mariko Shinobu!

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:21.000
Mariko Shinobu likes you so much.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.930
She really adores you!

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:26.470
And everyone wants you to herself.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:28.270
She... <b> </b>

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.070
She... Who?

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:30.210
Mariko-san.

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:34.210
I... sometimes she scares me a little....

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:47.690
8. I Want You

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:51.960
[Seiran School, next stop.]

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.580
I can't believe it!

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:09.780
A test, first period! That teacher is an akuma!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:13.450
Don't fall asleep during the test!

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:17.450
The real me is wide awake... but perhaps not my brain...

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.190
No way!

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:30.200
Bye! <b> </b>

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:30.940
Bye! Bye...

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:32.740
Oh, Tomoko...

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:34.010
Yes?

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:36.610
Tomoko, we can go home together today, right?

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:39.610
Of course! Sure - bye!

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:43.410
What is the meaning of this?

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:46.420
What is the meaning of this, tell me!

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:54.830
I told you Misonoo-san is no longer the Misonoo-san you knew!

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:56.890
Can't you understand that?

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.160
I understand enough!

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:03.170
I understand Nanako is Nanako no matter what happens.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:07.310
No matter what you say... or make up... I understand her well,

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:10.580
...because I've known her since we were both little kids.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.780
Pardon me...

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:14.710
How did it happen?

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:17.850
How did you get back together with Misonoo-san?

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.320
TELL ME!

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.920
Ow! Let me go!

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.790
No! I won't let go of you!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.860
And I won't let go of Nanako!

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:27.530
Hey, hey...

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:31.000
What are you two doing? Class is starting.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.090
Good morning!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:56.750
...Misonoo-san.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.690
Oh! Good morning, Shinobu-san!

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:01.690
First period is Literature.

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:04.830
Stand!

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:09.570
["Surprised by my footsteps, the face turned back towards me..."]

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:13.240
["Being an untalented poet, I cannot express well enough..."]

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:14.840
["Those dewy eyes! Those deep, shining eyes..."] <b> </b> <b> </b>

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:17.580
["Those dewy eyes! Those deep, shining eyes..."] I need to talk to you later. Something important.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:18.110
["Those dewy eyes! Those deep, shining eyes..."] Oh?

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:18.510
Oh?

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.390
Your birthday?

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:34.660
Yes, next Saturday.

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:38.930
I'm going to have a little party.

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:42.800
I really want you to come.

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:45.870
Well...

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:51.140
If you don't want to, that's ok. In fact, I'll understand if no one comes at all...

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:56.210
...since it is a party for the daughter of a pornographer...

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:00.750
Don't say that! I never thought of you that way!

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:02.960
Then...

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:04.290
Then, you'll come?

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:07.230
Well... ok!

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:10.700
Really? For sure?

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.370
You'll come? Terrific! Wonderful!

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:16.100
I'm so excited! I have to tell my mom!

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:22.570
It's next Saturday at six at the Hotel Royale.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:24.840
It's all arranged!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:28.180
I rented "The Rose Room".

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:30.320
"The Rose Room"?

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.850
Misonoo-san, thank you! I'm so happy!

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:40.390
What an impudent girl!

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:43.800
She is going to stay in the Sorority.

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:47.930
Misaki-san, you'd better come up with something new!

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:49.540
I have some new ideas...

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:54.070
Misaki Aya-san?

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.940
Could you come to the Sorority house now?

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:58.410
Yes...

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:00.350
Miya-sama is waiting for you.

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:02.550
Yes!

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:24.040
So this is the Sorority House!

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.170
If it weren't for HER being chosen, then I...

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:32.980
I'm so sorry to trouble you...

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:34.910
No, not at all!

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:38.180
What's your impression of our Sorority House?

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:41.320
Wonderful! It's gorgeous!

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:45.590
I've adored it ever since Junior High.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:47.130
Were you aware that...

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:50.260
...that there were times when members left the Sorority...

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:54.470
...and we accepted new members from the freshmen?

00:08:57.940 --> 00:09:01.470
Really? Then... I still have a chance!

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:05.480
No. There is no chance that you will be chosen.

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:08.750
At least, not now.

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:10.820
Why not!?

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.350
I think you already know why not.

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:28.700
I give you fair warning.

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:32.570
Don't become a victim of your own device.

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:39.510
You'd not only lose your chance to become a Sorority member...

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:43.180
...but you would forever face the hostility of the entire Sorority.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:12.150
Why is Tomoko so late?

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:16.080
Cut it out!

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.620
Tomoko! It must be Tomoko!

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:21.020
Stop, let go!

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:32.430
Shinobu-san!

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:35.700
No, I'm sorry, I'm not Tomoko...

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:39.240
Don't forget about this Saturday!

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.980
Oh... your friend's birthday party?

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:52.320
You can wear the dress your father bought you the other day.

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:56.860
What's the matter?

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.730
Oh, nothing...

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:01.730
I was just wondering what to bring for a present.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.800
That's just like you...

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:06.530
Just like me?

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:19.010
You're amazing!

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:25.150
For you to agree to go to Mariko's party is had enough in the first place...

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:28.090
...but you're even baking cookies for her!

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:33.760
And who is it helping me bake these cookies...? You should talk!

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:41.300
No way! I want to make them with lots of salt and tabasco!

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:49.710
So, what are you going to give to me?

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:50.710
What?

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:51.980
For my birthday!

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:55.520
Oh? And when is that?

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:56.520
You brat...!!

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:18.410
It's fabulous...

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:21.140
A birthday party... Here?

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:23.350
Whoever could be coming?

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:35.690
Ummm... excuse me, where is "The Rose Room"?

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.630
Would you be Miss Misonoo?

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:40.030
Yes!

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:42.300
Miss Shinobu is expecting you.

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:44.830
If you would come this way, please...

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:02.450
I'm honored to be invited today...

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.130
Misonoo-san!

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.930
You did come!

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:19.940
Ummm...

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.200
Happy Birthday! I am honored...

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:25.270
Cut it out! Come over here...

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:26.540
...and meet my Mom!

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:38.090
Shinobu-san is so beautiful...

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:43.360
Especially beautiful, today...

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:52.430
Pleased to meet you! Mariko has told me so much about you.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.040
Pleased to meet you! I'm Misonoo Nanako.

00:13:56.510 --> 00:13:58.910
She talks about you all the time.

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:02.910
I'm so happy you and Mariko have become friends!

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:06.320
Not at all! It's my pleasure!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.190
I hope you will be a blessing to her!

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:14.590
Too many formalities! Let's eat instead!

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:20.130
Mom...!

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.470
Mariko, why don't you blow out your candles?

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:27.140
Oh, right... But will I be able to... to blow out all 16 of them?

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:29.270
Go for it!

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:30.670
Yes... go for it!

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.140
Here goes!

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:49.290
Please go ahead and eat...

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:51.490
Do you like caviar? What about some wine?

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.100
So...

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:56.370
...where are all the others?

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.370
You're the only one!

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:01.240
What?

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:03.040
You heard me...

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:06.180
You're the only one I invited!

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:07.840
Only me?

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:13.780
You rented this... this enormous room...

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:15.650
Just for me?

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:17.720
Just me?

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:22.590
Until last year, it was only Mom and me...

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:41.210
Nobody would come if I invited them anyway.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:44.010
Even my father would remain in his study, working...

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:46.680
Mariko, stop that!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.750
Why? It's the truth!

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:52.960
Mariko-san...

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.370
Mariko-san!

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.170
Here, take this.

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:09.840
It's nothing special...

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:14.580
For me? Really? Can I open it?

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:15.580
Of course!

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:22.790
Look! Mom, cookies!

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:28.390
You baked these yourself, right?

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:28.990
Thank-you, thank-you Misonoo-san!

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:30.130
Mom, take a look!

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:33.400
They look delicious!

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:34.670
How wonderful!

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:38.000
They look so pretty!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:40.200
You're such a good cook, Misonoo-san!

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:55.350
It seems like... I didn't really know much at all... about Mariko.

00:16:57.150 --> 00:17:00.160
I... I guess...

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.090
I guess I'm glad I came after all.

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:14.770
I want you to know...

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.510
I'm very grateful for today.

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:21.510
...and for all the things you did for me, and...

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:24.920
...thank you for this fide home!

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:27.250
Oh, not at all, it was nothing!

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.790
It was you that made the party special.

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:31.720
It was our pleasure, really!

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:32.860
By the way...

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:34.730
Do you still have time? <b> </b>

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:35.660
Do you still have time? What?

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:39.530
My house is right here... I'd like to show it to you.

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:43.330
Well, I don't want to impose...

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.800
Nonsense! No imposition at all, right Mom?

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:51.680
Of course not! It's a bit sudden but Nanako would be very welcome!

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:54.350
Ok? Ok? Please?

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:58.420
Ok. Just for a little while...

00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:03.020
Turn around, let's go home!

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:20.640
Wow, these are delicious!

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:23.840
You're really good at baking cookies!

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:29.910
Oh, here's some coffee...

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:33.990
Do you want Cafe Royale, with brandy, or cafe-au-lait?

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:35.920
Oh - regular coffee is fine.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.660
Are you sure?

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:41.390
Oh... I wonder, Mariko-san...

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:45.330
Could I stop by and bring you some pies?

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:48.130
Because you pity me?

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:56.480
If so... no thank-you, I'm content as-is.

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:06.550
I'm sorry.

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:14.030
Really... I do very much appreciate your kind heart.

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:16.760
Honestly.

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:23.300
So, please, come by anytime!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:24.570
Ok.

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:28.170
By the way, would you like to take a bath with me? <b> </b>

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:29.240
By the way, would you like to take a bath with me? A bath?

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:36.050
Sure! Don't friends do that?

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.920
You do that with Tomoko, don't you?

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:39.990
No...

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:43.860
No way! You're kidding!

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:55.070
Your back is simply marvelous! <b> </b>

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:55.800
Your back is simply marvelous! What?

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:57.940
Your skin is so clear and pale!

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.540
So beautiful!

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:05.210
Stop staring at my back!

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:09.680
I like all beautiful things!

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:14.350
I like my body, too...

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:22.900
Just between you and me...

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:27.770
Sometimes I gaze into the mirror for hours and hours

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:29.900
...admiring the beauty of my body...!

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:34.240
What I really want is to be grown-up!

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:37.380
I want to be grown-up!

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:45.450
No doubt, Mariko's breasts are much bigger than mine!

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:50.120
She's like a beautiful rosebud, waiting to bloom...

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:57.200
Oh no, it's really late!

00:20:57.260 --> 00:21:00.130
Mariko-san, I have to go!

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.670
No, you mustn't! Please stay overnight!

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:03.540
What?

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:05.340
Now it's raining, too!

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:06.810
I'm sure it will be ok for you to stay!

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:09.340
You've stayed overnight with Tomoko, haven't you?

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:13.550
Good friends do that, don't they?

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.350
Yes, but I wasn't planning on it...

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:20.420
Mom and Dad will be worried if I don't come home.

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:24.420
It's ok! I'll just call your parents!

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:26.160
So please, won't you?

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:30.030
I'll come another time, when I have permission from my mom...

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.830
No! Don't go home!

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:34.300
Oh, Mariko! Please!

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:36.170
No, you can't! I won't let you go!

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.510
Wait!

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:48.050
I won't let you go.

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:50.580
If you do, I'll kill you.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:55.860
I'm serious, I'll kill you and then myself.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:59.460
No, please let me go!

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:00.860
Why are you doing this?

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:02.000
Don't!

00:22:08.870 --> 00:22:10.270
What are you doing!

00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:13.140
I won't let you go!

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:15.210
I absolutely will not let you go!

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:17.540
Open up! Open the door!

00:22:18.210 --> 00:22:20.680
Mariko! What are you doing?

00:22:20.680 --> 00:22:22.950
No! Stay away from here!

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:24.350
What are you doing?

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:25.890
No, don't!

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:28.490
What's the matter with you! Your friend is...

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:30.890
I told you to stay away!

00:22:35.430 --> 00:22:37.830
Mariko, what on earth is the matter with you?

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:39.970
It's none of your business!

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:42.900
No, wait! Don't go home!

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:45.310
Don't go home! Wait!

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:56.450
Why are you going? Isn't it ok to just stay overnight?

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:58.520
Aren't we friends?

00:22:58.650 --> 00:23:02.320
What! How can you say that? This isn't "friends"....

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:05.330
Please, get a hold of yourself! Mariko!

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:08.260
I won't let you go! I won't let you go!

00:23:08.260 --> 00:23:12.270
Let me go! Let me go! Let me go!

00:23:12.270 --> 00:23:13.400
Mama!

00:23:14.270 --> 00:23:15.140
Mariko!

00:23:16.470 --> 00:23:20.010
Help me! Help me Mom! Help!

00:23:20.270 --> 00:23:21.080
My Brother!...

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:33.950
Snow white...

00:23:34.620 --> 00:23:36.760
My mind went blank...

00:23:36.760 --> 00:23:40.900
Everything around was white... I kept running.

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:44.230
Brother...

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:47.440
The rain was so cold...

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:14.330
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.330 --> 00:24:19.800
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.270 --> 00:24:25.410
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.410 --> 00:24:30.880
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.610 --> 00:24:37.150
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.150 --> 00:24:42.630
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.630 --> 00:24:45.360
This is surely a game

00:24:45.360 --> 00:24:48.160
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.160 --> 00:24:50.570
Always dancing,

00:24:50.570 --> 00:24:55.840
Always capricious...

00:25:03.710 --> 00:25:06.920
Suddenly, Kaoru-no-Kimi again suffers from her recurring chest pains.

00:25:07.120 --> 00:25:11.190
Searching for medicine, Nanako goes to Rei for help...

00:25:11.320 --> 00:25:14.920
But, Rei seems ambivalent and unresponsive...

00:25:15.190 --> 00:25:18.190
So Nanako slaps her!

00:25:19.060 --> 00:25:19.860
Next episode: <b> </b>

00:25:19.860 --> 00:25:22.460
Next episode: Relapse!

00:25:23.070 --> 00:25:24.670
Brother, Dear Brother... <b> </b>

00:25:24.670 --> 00:25:28.470
Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...
